ineering services, and engages in loan financing. Property investment also forms a component of its business activities. The company adopted its current name in May 2020, having previously been known as WE Solutions Limited.","description_en":"Headquartered in Sheung Wan, Hong Kong, and established in 2002, Apollo Future Mobility Group Limited operates as an investment holding company with a diverse portfolio of businesses. The firm engages in the international trading, retail, and wholesale of luxury goods like jewelry and watches, along with other commodities, serving markets across Mainland China, Hong Kong, Japan, Germany, and beyond. A significant part of its operations involves the design, development, production, and global sales of high-performance hypercars. Additionally, the company provides advanced mobility technology solutions, offers specialized engineering services, and engages in loan financing. Property investment also forms a component of its business activities. The company adopted its current name in May 2020, having previously been known as WE Solutions Limited.","description_zh":null,"address":"Li Po Chun Chambers","city":"Hong Kong","state":null,"zip":null,"country":"HK","phone":"852 2810 6683","full_address":"Li Po Chun Chambers, Hong Kong, HK","year_high":0.92,"year_low":0.38,"range_52w":"0.38-0.92","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[{"symbol":"0860.HK","date":"2023-12-14","numerator":1,"denominator":20,"splitType":"stock-split"},{"symbol":"0860.HK","date":"2015-03-17","numerator":1,"denominator":10,"splitType":"stock-split"},{"symbol":"0860.HK","date":"2014-09-08","numerator":1,"denominator":10,"splitType":"stock-split"},{"symbol":"0860.HK","date":"2010-07-02","numerator":7,"denominator":5,"splitType":"stock-split"}],"news":[],"historical_dcf_series":null,"real_5y_prices":[],"dataAvailability":{"currentPrice":null,"hkdRiskFreeRa